
##### A. frmtmb fits these; drmTMB 0.7.0 refusals are in surface.log

=== frm: nonlinear formula
frm(bf(y ~ a * exp(b * x), a ~ 1 + (1 | g), b ~ 1, nl = TRUE), family = gaussian(), data = d, start = list(beta = c(1, 
    0.3))) 
  FITTED. logLik = -588.665598904  convergence = 0 ( relative convergence (4) )

=== frm: three responses with rescor
frm(mvbf(bf(y ~ x), bf(y2 ~ x), bf(y3 ~ x)) + set_rescor(TRUE), family = gaussian(), data = d) 
  FITTED. logLik = -1678.70945402  convergence = 0 ( relative convergence (4) )

=== frm: mixed-family multivariate, gaussian + negbinomial, shared |p|
