=== frm: custom family (logistic log-density)
frm(bf(y ~ x), data = d, family = custom_family("mylogistic", dpars = c("mu", "sigma"), links = list(mu = "identity", 
    sigma = "log"), type = "continuous", lpdf = function(y, dpars, aterms) -(y - dpars$mu)/dpars$sigma - 
    log(dpars$sigma) - 2 * log1p(exp(-(y - dpars$mu)/dpars$sigma)))) 
  FITTED. logLik = -600.996470468  convergence = 0 ( relative convergence (4) )

